    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The Disciple is a lightweight Quarian-designed shotgun built for use in confined ship corridors where a full-sized combat shotgun would be unwieldy. It fires a wide scatter pattern at low weight cost, making it popular among crew members who need close-range stopping power without sacrificing mobility. Its modest round-per-round damage is compensated by its rapid cycling and the simply overwhelming number of pellets it puts into a small area.</p>"
